  "historyNote": "#6057-B, eff 6-30-95; ss by #7879, eff 4-26-03; amd by #8129, eff 7-28-04; ss by #9791, eff 10-1-10; ss by #10000, eff 10-1-11; ss by #10175, eff 9-1-12; ss by #13510, eff 12-17-22",
